@baseUrl = http://localhost:6308/api
@token = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 完整图标目录（含历史回显需要的停用项）
GET {{baseUrl}}/icons
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 商家可选图标
GET {{baseUrl}}/icons?scene=merchant&selectableOnly=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 账户适用类型与默认规则
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/options
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
